      "content": "The Nixhub API lets you search over 1 million package versions for over 100,000 Nix packages. Search for packages, look up version history, and resolve a package name + version to a nixpkgs commit and flake installable for use with Devbox or Nix. Free for personal use, subject to IP-based rate limiting. Built and operated by Jetify.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Jetify",
